# BFS theo tầng dựng đồ thị cha, rồi DFS ngược từ endWord để liệt kê mọi đường ngắn nhất
from collections import defaultdict
def solve(begin, end, words):
    ws = set(words)
    if end not in ws: return []
    parents = defaultdict(set); layer = {begin}; ws.discard(begin); found = False
    while layer and not found:
        ws -= layer; nxt = set()
        for w in layer:
            for i in range(len(w)):
                for c in 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz':
                    nw = w[:i] + c + w[i+1:]
                    if nw in ws:
                        nxt.add(nw); parents[nw].add(w)
                        if nw == end: found = True
        layer = nxt
    if not found: return []
    res = []
    def dfs(w, path):
        if w == begin: res.append(path[::-1]); return
        for p in parents[w]: dfs(p, path + [p])
    dfs(end, [end]); return sorted(res)
